## What it is

A battle royale shooter centered on scavenging equipment, positioning, and surviving a shrinking play area.

## Before you install

The base game is listed as free to play. Check the official store for optional purchases and current requirements. Compare your operating system, graphics hardware, memory, and available storage with the full listing, including any Steam client notices. Minimum specifications do not establish a particular frame rate.

PUBG: BATTLEGROUNDS is a battle royale. Steam’s app details, checked 8 November 2026, list Windows for the free base game. Compare your PC with the system requirements on that page, and treat any paid extras as separate from the free game.

